              "description": "local-git-namespace-trust: committed config and immutable Git reads work through fixed protected system executables in host, systemd and nested Codex namespaces while hostile ownership/configuration/replacement cases fail."
            },
            {
              "id": "AC2",
              "description": "actor-worktree-hook-binding: shipped Stop, steering and capture hooks find the exact actor-bound physical project run, preserve shared coordination roots and never gate unrelated actors."
            },
            {
              "id": "AC3",
              "description": "execute-record-synchronize: next_action derives producer execution, evidence submission and synchronization separately from the canonical envelope; actual public evidence advances gates and status alone does not."
            },
