              "id": "AC5",
              "description": "installable-station-candidate: an installable candidate package works in an isolated Station consumer on brian-media under the same user-namespace, public workflow and actor-hook contracts; published registry/provenance/stable consumer/original issue closure remain mandatory post-merge rollout milestones."
            },
            {
              "id": "AC6",
              "description": "value-focused-gates: supported evidence retains its real terminal outcome; predictable payload/review/command/publication incompatibility is rejected before expensive execution; unchanged reviewed implementation is not invalidated by later progress context; supported revision-bound receipt reuse avoids repeated checks while stale, failed, zero-test and forged evidence stays non-confirming."
            }
